{"id":"661457","name":"香菇蒸鸡翅根","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/661457/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡翅根","amount":"500g"},{"name":"干香菇","amount":"8朵"},{"name":"豆皮","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"生粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡翅根洗净，肉厚的地方用刀划开备用。","img":"images/661457/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"干香菇泡发，对半切开备用。","img":"images/661457/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆皮泡发备用。","img":"images/661457/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱洗净切段备用。","img":"images/661457/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡翅根加入盐、生抽。","img":"images/661457/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"还有蚝油。","img":"images/661457/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"因为没生姜了，就放了点姜粉，有生姜的就切几片就好。","img":"images/661457/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后加点生粉以及少许水，抓拌均匀。","img":"images/661457/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"腌制两个小时。","img":"images/661457/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"腌好的鸡翅根加入香菇、葱，抓拌均匀。","img":"images/661457/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盘子底铺上豆皮。","img":"images/661457/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再铺上鸡翅根。","img":"images/661457/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"隔水上锅蒸，水开后中火蒸25分钟即可。","img":"images/661457/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}